{"id":"5bc7edf5698ebdc7","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics.md","title":"PDA Acceptance by Empty Stack","display":"df-pda-empty-stack-language — PDA Acceptance by Empty Stack","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics","aliases":["73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics","73-df-pda-empty-stack-language"],"display":"df-pda-empty-stack-language — PDA Acceptance by Empty Stack","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</span><span>73-df-pda-empty-stack-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pda-empty-stack-language — PDA Acceptance by Empty Stack"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" href=\"?note=c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" title=\"73-df-pda-transition-semantics\">73-df-pda-transition-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (pushdown automaton)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_M^*\">\\(\\vdash_M^*\\)</span> (zero-or-more transition relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" href=\"?note=c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8\" title=\"73-df-pda-transition-semantics\">73-df-pda-transition-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Empty-stack acceptance ignores the designated final-state set; this is a distinct language operation from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_F(M)\">\\(L_F(M)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-transition-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash_M^*$ (zero-or-more transition relation, see [[73-df-pda-transition-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_M^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL_{\\varnothing}(M)\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists q\\in Q\\;\n((q_0,w,\\langle Z_0\\rangle)\\vdash_M^*(q,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"L_F(M)","display":false}],"bytes":958,"backlinks":[{"id":"7dd8ceb2520b13ca","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$, $L_F$, and $L_{\\varnothing}$ (PDA acceptance modes, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]] and [[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]])"}],"outgoing":["c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8"]}